OL,3,ATrump says Kennedy Center to close as
OL,4,Acourt rules his name must stay off
OL,5,Abuilding
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe board, which is chaired by Trump
OL,8,Fand has his cabinet members and allies,
OL,9,Fapproved a resolution in August that
OL,10,Fcalled for the inscription "Renovated
OL,11,Fand Restored by President Donald J.
OL,12,FTrump" to be added to the venue.
OL,14,FTrump announced the addition of his
OL,15,Fname to the institution, among other
OL,16,Frebranding measures across the nation's
OL,17,Fcapital, last year.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
